     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-tdf-3tc-dtg-300-300-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-tdf-3tc-dtg-300-300-50\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 300/300/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-tdf-3tc-efv-300-300-400<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-tdf-3tc-efv-300-300-400\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Efavirenz 300/300/400 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-taf-ftc-dtg-25-200-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-taf-ftc-dtg-25-200-50\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir alafenamide/Emtricitabine/Dolutegravir 25/200/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-taf-3tc-dtg-25-300-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-taf-3tc-dtg-25-300-50\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir alafenamide/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 25/300/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-abc-3tc-600-300<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-abc-3tc-600-300\"> </a></td><td>Abacavir/Lamivudine 600/300 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-azt-3tc-300-150<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-azt-3tc-300-150\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine/Lamivudine 300/150 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-tdf-3tc-300-300<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-tdf-3tc-300-300\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine 300/300 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-azt-300<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-azt-300\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine 300 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-atv-r-300-100<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-atv-r-300-100\"> </a></td><td>Atazanavir/Ritonavir 300/100 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-3tc-150<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-3tc-150\"> </a></td><td>Lamivudine 150 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-drv-600<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-drv-600\"> </a></td><td>Darunavir 600 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-rtv-100<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-rtv-100\"> </a></td><td>Ritonavir 100 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-drv-r-400-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-drv-r-400-50\"> </a></td><td>Darunavir/Ritonavir 400/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">adult-dtg-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-dtg-50\"> </a></td><td>Dolutegravir 50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form permits once- or twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-abc-3tc-120-60<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-abc-3tc-120-60\"> </a></td><td>Abacavir/Lamivudine 120/60 mg</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form permits once- or twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-azt-3tc-60-30<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-azt-3tc-60-30\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine/Lamivudine 60/30 mg</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-nvp-50-per-5ml<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-nvp-50-per-5ml\"> </a></td><td>Nevirapine 50 mg/5 mL</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-abc-60<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-abc-60\"> </a></td><td>Abacavir 60 mg</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form permits once- or twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-lpv-r-100-25<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-lpv-r-100-25\"> </a></td><td>Lopinavir/Ritonavir 100/25 mg</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-ral-25<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-ral-25\"> </a></td><td>Raltegravir 25 mg</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-azt-10-per-ml<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-azt-10-per-ml\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine 10 mg/mL</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">paediatric-dtg-10<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-paediatric-dtg-10\"> </a></td><td>Dolutegravir 10 mg</td><td>Paediatric ART formulation. The source form 