td><td>Drug for opportunistic-infection prophylaxis or treatment; strength is entered separately.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">oi-flucytosine-500<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-oi-flucytosine-500\"> </a></td><td>Flucytosine 500 mg</td><td>The source form notes 100 mg/kg in four divided doses and preprints four-times-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">oi-cotrimoxazole-inh-pyridoxine-960-300-25<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-oi-cotrimoxazole-inh-pyridoxine-960-300-25\"> </a></td><td>Co-trimoxazole/Isoniazid/Pyridoxine 960/300/25 mg</td><td>Fixed-dose combination listed under drugs for opportunistic-infection prophylaxis or treatment.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">oi-nystatin<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-oi-nystatin\"> </a></td><td>Nystatin</td><td>Drug for opportunistic-infection prophylaxis or treatment; strength is entered separately.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">oi-liposomal-amphotericin-b-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-oi-liposomal-amphotericin-b-50\"> </a></td><td>Liposomal Amphotericin B 50 mg</td><td>The source form notes 3 mg/kg intravenously daily.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-isoniazid-100<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-isoniazid-100\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid 100 mg</td><td>Drug for TB preventive therapy. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-isoniazid-300<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-isoniazid-300\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid 300 mg</td><td>Drug for TB preventive therapy. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-isoniazid-rifapentine-3hp<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-isoniazid-rifapentine-3hp\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid/Rifapentine (3HP)</td><td>TB preventive therapy regimen listed on the source form; strength is entered separately.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-other<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-other\"> </a></td><td>Other TB preventive therapy drug or regimen</td><td>A TB preventive therapy drug or regimen not otherwise listed; specify separately.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prep-cabotegravir-200-per-ml-3ml-vial<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-prep-cabotegravir-200-per-ml-3ml-vial\"> </a></td><td>Cabotegravir 200 mg/mL (3 mL vial)</td><td>PrEP product listed on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prep-lenacapavir-600-tablet<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-prep-lenacapavir-600-tablet\"> </a></td><td>Lenacapavir 600 mg tablet</td><td>PrEP product listed on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prep-lenacapavir-927-per-3ml-injection<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-prep-lenacapavir-927-per-3ml-injection\"> </a></td><td>Lenacapavir 927 mg/3 mL injection</td><td>PrEP product listed on the source form.</td></tr></table></div>"
